  "remarks": "Reports each gap at the first goal of the block that needs it; afterwards the competence counts as available to later goals that secure that goal. Read strictly, these gaps would come back in almost every goal of the block. Pattern: the entry chain secures only grade 5–6 arithmetic plus Zuordnungen, Funktionsbegriff and Funktionswerte; no goal from grades 7–9 is secured in it. Ableitungen elementarer Funktionen berechnen does not build on the rule goals; its exponential part depends on goals that themselves require it. Four tangent and slope goals overlap with inconsistent prerequisites. A parallel J10 derivative chain covers the same content and builds on the J9 goals. Outside the block: neither Quadratische Gleichungen lösen nor Nullstellen linearer Funktionen berechnen secures Lineare Gleichungen systematisch lösen. Judged from descriptions and derived contexts only."
